 tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-u9uoef"><div data-rid="e742fe0c-5f8b-4017-813c-0155da98ec22" class="r-t5yzsb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How to use</p></span></div><div data-rid="d587f7a6-736d-4945-823a-a54f21c8e308" class="r-ouo1jm" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2j3eb2:"><div data-rid="b272deb8-20c2-4abf-b4de-42805cab7bbc" class="r-g2c6ta"><div data-rid="ac7f3ee3-ab7c-486d-9528-da71c6c55126" class="r-7wd3jq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Recommended Dose:</p><p>Take 2 capsules 30 minutes before training or mentally demanding tasks.</p><br><p>Can be taken with or without food.</p><br><p>Best Practices:</p><br><p>For Pre-Workout:</p><p>Take 30 minutes before your warm-up. You'll feel sharper mind-muscle connection and sustained mental clarity throughout your session.</p><br><p>For Daily Focus:</p><p>Take first thing in the morning or 30 minutes before deep work. Supports razor-sharp focus and eliminates procrastination without jitters or crashes.</p><br><p>For Best Results:</p><p>Use consistently for 30-90 days to experience cumulative cognitive benefits (neurogenesis, enhanced coordination, improved stress resilience).</p><br><p>Safety Notes:</p><p>- Do not exceed 2 capsules per day unless directed by a healthcare provider</p><p>- Not recommended for pregnant or nursing women</p><p>- Consult your doctor if you have a medical condition or are taking medication</p><p>- Keep out of reach of children</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6c09f7dc-1665-4796-ac0f-7ad7