1" id="list-wrapper" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1qm2u73"><div data-rid="acf16028-0e34-4c85-8de9-643e4452fddf" class="r-1uyy3e5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><ul><li><p>Quinten grew up with a rare bone disorder, in and out of surgeries. James navigated foster care, dealing with instability and constant change. Both found their turning point when they chose to take control through intentional training. </p></li></ul></span></div><div data-rid="4c012a05-f295-45e7-a2af-1522037dc7cf" class="r-185jl0v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><ul><li><p>What started as physical training quickly became something deeper. Fitness became a tool for clarity, discipline, resilience and identity. They didn't just build stronger bodies. They built stronger minds. </p></li></ul></span></div><div data-rid="92d8eb46-129b-4d6c-a059-560846fb646d" class="r-1oeezf1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><ul><li><p>From this experience, Intent Fit was created: a performance brand grounded in the truth that when you train your mind and body with intention, you change your life."</p></li></ul></span></div></div></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<a data-rid="9c389fe7-2340-41a6-ae4e-e5d4891b381f" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-by6s7a alchemy-rte" target="_blank" href="https://intent-fit.com/pages/our-stories" rel="noreferrer"><div data-rid="df5031ad-1d1b-46f5-adbb-91517c1eccf2" class="r-1jkvqms alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Us</p></span></div></a>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div><div data-rid="d713210b-05d9-43f9-a9f2-79ffeda1d3fa" class="r-1p5dkx8"><picture data-rid="792458d3-2c2a-48ba-8bdf-577785dab9c3" class="r-qfy4e9"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/6ba2beb1-c656-4bdd-8f8f-50700d351a87/6afa9226-5285-4a04-be39-53b2e3cfc965?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/6ba2beb1-c656-4bdd-8f8f-50700d351a87/6afa9226-5285-